      "content": "but that's what people always say, right? \"you're just tired,\" \"it gets better,\" \"you just need to find yourself.\" but it feels more permanent than that. like there's just a void where my ability to keep going used to be. if you're just dust, there isn't really a \"you\" left to find. it's like trying to fix a glass that's been pulverized. it's not just cracked, it's just... gone.",
